-- =============================================================================
-- Qahse.WindL Batch Template
-- Mode=BATCH, template.qwd + Excel override table
-- =============================================================================

---------------------- WindL Working Mode -------------------------------------
BATCH       Mode            - Mode: GENERATE / IMPORT / BATCH

---------------------- Generate Settings --------------------------------------
true        CalWu           - Enable u turbulence component
true        CalWv           - Enable v turbulence component
true        CalWw           - Enable w turbulence component
true        WrBlwnd         - Export Bladed .wnd
true        WrTrbts         - Export TurbSim .bts
false       WrTrwnd         - Export TurbSim-compatible .wnd

---------------------- Import Settings {Mode=IMPORT only} --------------------
0           VFlowAng        - Vertical inflow angle (deg)
0           HFlowAng        - Horizontal inflow angle (deg)
true        CycleWind       - Cycle imported time history
""          TurWindFile     - Imported .wnd/.bts path
TRILINEAR   InterpMethod    - Import interpolation method

---------------------- Grid And Turbine ---------------------------------------
12345       RandSeed        - Random seed
31          NumPointY       - Horizontal grid points
31          NumPointZ       - Vertical grid points
160         LenWidthY       - Grid width (m)
160         LenHeightZ      - Grid height (m)
660         WindDuration    - Duration (s)
0.05        TimeStep        - Time step (s)
90          HubHt           - Hub height (m)

---------------------- Atmospheric Boundary Conditions ------------------------
IEC_KAIMAL  TurbModel       - Turbulence spectrum model
""          UserTurbFile    - User spectrum/time-series file
true        UseIECSimmga    - Apply IEC scaling to user spectra
ED3         IECStandard     - IEC edition
Class_I     IECClass        - Turbine class
Class_B     TurbulenceClass - Turbulence class
NTM         WindModel       - IEC wind condition
PL          ShearType       - Shear type
DEFAULT_PROFILE WindProfileType - Wind profile type
""          UserShearFile   - User shear/profile file
-1          RefHt           - Reference height
11.4        MeanWindSpeed   - Mean wind speed (m/s), NREL 5MW rated condition
0.14        PLExp           - Power-law exponent
0.03        Z0              - Roughness length (m)

---------------------- Optional Model Parameters ------------------------------
0           VRef
126         RotorDiameter
0           TurbIntensity
-1          ScaleIEC
2           ETMc
0           AnalysisTime
0           Rich_No
0           UStar
0           ZL
0           ZI
0           PC_UW
0           PC_UV
0           PC_VW
0           Latitude
0           TI_u
0           TI_v
0           TI_w
0           MannAlphaEps
0           MannScalelength
0           MannGamma
0           MannMaxL
0           MannNx
0           MannNy
0           MannNz
default     CohMod1
default     CohMod2
default     CohMod3
0           CohDecayU
0           CohDecayV
0           CohDecayW
0           CohScaleB
0           CohExp
true        AllowCohApprox
Turbulent   EWMType
0           GustPeriod
0           EventStart
POSITIVE    EventSign
0           EcdVcog

---------------------- Output Control -----------------------------------------
./batch_output_template WrWndPath       - Default single-case output dir; batch mode overrides this per case
NREL5MW_IEC3_1_Batch   WrWndName       - Default single-case output name; batch mode overrides this with CaseName
true        SumPrint        - Export .sum

---------------------- Batch Control ------------------------------------------
./batch_templates/IEC61400-3-1_WindCases.xlsx BatchExcel      - Batch Excel workbook path
Cases       BatchSheet      - Batch worksheet name
./batch_output/IEC61400-3-1_NREL5MW BatchOutputDir - Batch root output directory
0           BatchThreads    - Batch worker count; 0 means auto
subprocess  BatchLauncher   - Batch launcher: subprocess / inproc
false       BatchValidateOnly - true means validate only, do not generate wind files
